#: src/ambition/Ambition_control.cc:77
msgid ""
"We hope that you have enjoyed playing Seven Kingdoms: Ambition!\n"
"We would appreciate your feedback on the game and to hear what else you "
"would like to see in the game.\n"
"Would you be willing to share your feedback now?  (Will open in a web "
"browser.)"
msgstr ""
"Speramus te Seven Kingdoms: Ambition libenter lusisse!\n"
"Gratum nobis esset opiniones tuas de ludo accipere et audire quid aliud in "
"ludo videre velis.\n"
"Visne opiniones tuas nunc communicare?  (In navigatro interreti aperietur.)"

#: src/ambition/Ambition_control.cc:83
msgid "I want to be heard!"
msgstr "Audiri cupio!"

#: src/ambition/Ambition_control.cc:84
msgid "Later"
msgstr "Postea"

#: src/ambition/Ambition_control.cc:108
msgid "End of replay"
msgstr "Finis iterationis"

