"Rosell Saldaña's name on the What's New screen)."
msgstr ""
"Correcta est exhibitio notarum non solitarum in Windows (praesertim nomen "
"Júlia Rosell Saldaña in pagina Quid Novi)."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Used translated War Machine names on the War Factory building information "
"panels."
msgstr ""
"Nomina translata Machinarum Bellicarum in tabellis informationis Officinae "
"Belli adhibita sunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Used translated Greater Being names on the Seat of Power building "
"information panels."
msgstr ""
"Nomina translata Entium Maiorum in tabellis informationis Sedis Potestatis "
"adhibita sunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.2.9 -- 2026-06-05"
msgstr "v3.2.9 -- 2026-06-05"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added a Catalan translation, thanks to Júlia Rosell Saldaña."
msgstr "Catalana adiecit translationem per Iúlia Rosell Saldaña."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Translate War Machine identifiers (their type and level when they are in a "
"list)."
msgstr ""
"Bellum Machina identificatoria (eorum genus et gradus cum in indice sunt)."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Music now plays on the tutorial and scenario selection screens."
msgstr "Musica nunc ludit in tegumenta paedagogica et missione delectu."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Music is paused in the multiplayer game lobby."
msgstr "Musica in lusoribus lusoribus VESTIBULUM consistit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.2.8 -- 2025-12-16"
msgstr "v3.2.8 -- 2025-12-16"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Greatly expanded the German translation, thanks to Einheit-101."
msgstr "Germanam translationem magnopere dilatavit, Einheit-CI gratias egit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added scrolling with the mouse wheel, touchpad, up/down, home/end, and pg up/"
"down keys to the tutorial selection list."
msgstr ""
"Addita est volutatio rota muris, tabella tactili, clavibus sursum/deorsum, "
"initii/finis, et paginae sursum/deorsum, ad indicem selectionis "
"exercitationum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed builders sometimes going to their buildings' rally points instead of "
"to the building where they were requested by the request builder button.  "
"The workaround for this means that builders will always ignore rally points, "
"for the time being."
msgstr ""
"Firmi structores interdum ad suas aedificia conglobanda ibant puncta loco ad "
"aedificium ubi petentibus fabricatoris puga postulabantur.  Opus hoc "
"significat quod aedificantes semper colligentes puncta neglegunt, pro "
"tempore existente."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash on hovering over the caravan list of the Trade Report when you "
"have no caravans."
msgstr ""
"Correcta est ruina quae fiebat cum super indicem caravanarum Relationis "
"Commercii librabas dum nullas caravanas habebas."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed replay desyncs caused by setting Caravan and trade ship stop pickup "
"types, deleting trade stops, copying trade routes, or automatic caravan "
"replacement."
msgstr ""
"Correctae sunt desynchronizationes repetitionis causatae ex constitutione "
"generum stationum receptionis Caravanarum et navium mercatoriarum, delendo "
"stationes mercatorias, transcribendo vias mercatorias, vel substitutione "
"automatica caravanarum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed and improved the German translation, thanks to Einheit-101."
msgstr "Certam et meliorem versionem germanicam, egit Einheit-CI."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed non-English tutorial descriptions getting cut off at the bottom, by "
"adding a scroll bar and buttons, so that all the text can be scrolled and "
"read."
msgstr ""
"Exercitatioes descriptiones certae non-anglicae in fundo abscissae, addendo "
"volumen vectem et globulis, ita ut omnes textus plicari et legere possint."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the config.txt settings not taking effect when there was only a 7kaa "
"config.txt and not an Ambition one."
msgstr ""
"Correctum est quod occasus config.txt vim non habebant cum solum config.txt "
"ipsius 7kaa adesset nec ullum Ambitionis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added button help text to the Egyptian, Mughal, and Zulu Greater Being spell "
"buttons."
msgstr ""
"Bullae additae ope textus ope globuli Aegyptiorum Mughal et Zulu Maioris "
"incantamentum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the Encyclopaedia slideshow showing a blank image until the mouse was "
"moved."
msgstr ""
"Fixit in Encyclopaedia lapsus monstrans imaginem blank donec mure commota "
"est."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed the grammar in the \"Desperate Bowmen\" scenario description."
msgstr ""
"Praefixo grammatica in \"Sagittariis desperatis\" descriptio missionis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the manual showing the wrong targeting type for the Mughal Greater "
"Being (Djinni)."
msgstr ""
"Praefixum manuale ostendens iniuriam targeting genus pro Mughal Maiore Esse "
"(Djinni)."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Changed the default setting for Help from Full to Brief, to avoid "
"overwhelming new players with information panels.  This only applies to new "
"installations."
msgstr ""
"Mutatus est occasus praedefinitus Auxilii a Pleno ad Breve, ne novi lusores "
"tabellis informationum obruantur. Hoc solum ad novas installationes pertinet."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Automatically select the Greater Being upon invoking it at a Seat of Power."
msgstr "Automatarie maiorem Ens eligunt in invocatione apud sedem potestatis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Music now plays on the encyclopaedia."
msgstr "Musica nunc in encyclopaedia ludit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "More changes to make development easier."
msgstr "Plures mutationes evolutionis facilius faciunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.2.7 -- 2025-10-24"
msgstr "v3.2.7 -- 2025-10-24"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Automatically detect the language on Windows."
msgstr "Automatarie linguam in Fenestra deprehendere."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added a Dutch translation, thanks to Jan Miedema."
msgstr "Addidit translationem Batavicam, per Ian Miedema."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the average target resistance of independent towns on the information "
"panel when you have workers."
msgstr ""
"Monstrare scopum mediocrem resistentia oppidorum independentium in tabella "
"delatione cum operarios habes."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed target resistance being shown incorrectly when you have workers in the "
"independent town."
msgstr ""
"Scopum fixum resistentia perperam demonstratur cum operarios in oppido "
"independentis habes."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the buttons of the Harbour interface overlapping with the production "
"progress bar."
msgstr "Fixum est globulis instrumenti portus productionis vectis imbricatis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the Harbour production count not being placed properly on the button."
msgstr "Portum productionem constituit comitem non recte in felis posito."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed mines built outside of natural resources showing \"null\" on their "
"information panels."
msgstr ""
"Fodinae fixa extra facultates naturales aedificatae ostendunt \"nullas\" in "
"tabulis indicio eorum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed not being able to play replays (R key) because the NONAME.RPL file was "
"being saved to the wrong place."
msgstr ""
"Certum non esse posse redditiones lusorias (R key) quia fasciculus "
"NONAME.RPL locus iniuriae servatus erat."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Base the display of the building guide on the Help setting.  Not shown when "
"set to None; only the grid lines when set to Brief; and both highlighting "
"and grid lines when set to Detailed."
msgstr ""
"Ostensio ducis aedificiorum ex occasu Auxilii pendet. Non ostenditur cum ad "
"Nullum positum est; solum lineae reticuli cum ad Breve; et illustratio et "
"lineae reticuli cum ad Copiosum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Changed the Harbour ship count to include the currently-building ship, as it "
"blocks other ships from entering, so counts towards the limit."
msgstr ""
"Navem portum mutavit, ut navem aedificantem includat, sicut alias naves ab "
"introitu impedit, sic ad terminum computat."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Pause replays at the end instead of immediately exiting to the menu without "
"warning."
msgstr "Intermissio reddit in fine loco statim exiens in tabula improvisa."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.2.6 -- 2025-10-08"
msgstr "v3.2.6 -- 2025-10-08"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"The behaviour of the newly added information panels and the building hitbars "
"(see the sections below) is controlled (for now*) by the Help level setting "
"in the Options menu.  You are encouraged to tweak this setting to your "
"liking."
msgstr ""
"Mores tabularum notitiarum recentium additarum et hitbarum aedificiorum "
"(vide sectiones infra) regitur (iam*) ab Auxilium gradus occasu in tabula "
"Optiones.  Hoc hortatus es ut hoc institutum tibi cordi sit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "When set to None, they will never be displayed."
msgstr "Cum nulla posuere, numquam pariatur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"When set to Brief, they will be displayed for the currently selected "
"building and any building that is hovered over with the mouse."
msgstr ""
"Cum ad Breve ponentur, ad electum aedificium et omne aedificium quod mus "
"volitatur ostendentur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"When set to Detailed, they will be displayed for all buildings all the time."
msgstr ""
"Cum ad Detailed positae, pro omnibus aedificiis omni tempore ostendentur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"* Ambition will have its own Settings menu with more fine-grained control "
"over features in the future."
msgstr ""
"* Ambitio Optiones tabulam suam habebit cum subtiliore imperio linearum in "
"futuro."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show an information panel for Towns, with the number of peasants, total "
"population, number of races, and loyalty or resistance."
msgstr ""
"Informatio tabellariorum oppidorum, cum agrestium numero, summa populus, "
"gentium numero, fidelitate vel resistentia."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show an information panel for Forts, with the general or king leadership "
"level, number of soldiers, and the approximate total strength, including the "
"effects of the leader."
msgstr ""
"Decuriam informationis forts monstrant cum ducibus dux vel rex gradus, "
"numerum militum, et robur, cum effectibus ducis, additis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show information panels for other buildings, with information relevant to "
"them, such as worker and good counts."
msgstr ""
"Informationes tabulas in aliis aedificiis ostendere, cum informationes ad "
"eas pertinentes, ut operarius et bonae copiae."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show an information panel for Fryhtan Lairs with their species name and "
"level.  The level is an approximate relative reflection of the species' "
"strength and the gold reward for killing Ordos.  Note that this reflects "
"only the species, not the current unit count and combat level, which can "
"only be seen with a Phoenix."
msgstr ""
"Monstrare tabellam informationis pro Fryhtan Lairs cum speciebus suis nomen "
"et gradus.  gradus proximus est repercussio relativa specierum robur et "
"aurum praemium occisionis Ordos.  Nota hoc reflectere solum species, non "
"praesentem unitatem numerare et pugnam gradus, quae solum cum Phoenice "
"videri potest."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added a progress bar for Seats of Power."
msgstr "Additamentum vectis ad sedes potestatis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Greater Beings will now go to the rally points of their Seats of Power when "
"they are summoned."
msgstr "Maiora iam ad sedes suae potestatis conveniant, cum vocati fuerint."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash that sometimes happened after an earthquake, where automatic "
"caravan cloning would try to both clone and retire an idle caravan at the "
"same time, resulting in a segfault."
msgstr ""
"Fragorem fixum, qui interdum post terrae motum accidit, ubi automatariae "
"comitatus perplexus ambobus clone conetur et viatores otiosos simul cedere, "
"inde in segfault."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the build Fort keybind (F) not working because it was conflicting with "
"selecting a Fort.  The default keybind for selecting a fort has been changed "
"to `N`.  You can change by binding the `KEYEVENT_ _BUILD_ _CAMP` and "
"`KEYEVENT_ _GOTO_ _CAMP` events to different keys in the config.txt file."
msgstr ""
"Correcta est clavis (F) ad Castellum aedificandum quae non operabatur quia "
"cum Castelli selectione pugnabat. Clavis praedefinita ad Castellum "
"seligendum in `N` mutata est. Mutare potes eventus `KEYEVENT_ _BUILD_ _CAMP` "
"et `KEYEVENT_ _GOTO_ _CAMP` ad diversas claves in fasciculo config.txt "
"adligando."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed spy Steal Reports option not working in Towns."
msgstr ""
"Fixum speculatorem Futurum Renuntiationes optionis non operandi in Oppidis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed translations not working on Windows and always showing English.  Now, "
"the game will respect the config.txt `locale` setting on Windows."
msgstr ""
"Correctae sunt translationes quae in Windows non operabantur et semper "
"Anglice ostendebant. Nunc ludus occasum `locale` config.txt in Windows "
"observabit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed cloned caravans sometimes appearing on another island or in an "
"otherwise inaccessible location and not being able to follow its route."
msgstr ""
"Semitae affixae fixae interdum apparentes in alia insula vel in loco alio "
"inaccesso et non valentes iter suum sequi."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Changed when building hitbars are displayed based on the help setting in the "
"options menu.  When it is set to None, building hitbars will never be "
"displayed.  When it is set to Brief, they will be displayed for the "
"currently selected building and any building hovered over with the mouse.  "
"When it is set to Detailed, they will be displayed as per the old behaviour--"
"when the building is at less than 100% hitpoints."
msgstr ""
"Mutatum est quando virgae valetudinis aedificiorum ostendantur, ex occasu "
"Auxilii in indice optionum. Cum ad Nullum positum est, virgae valetudinis "
"aedificiorum numquam ostendentur. Cum ad Breve, ostendentur pro aedificio "
"nunc selecto et quovis aedificio super quod mus libratur. Cum ad Copiosum, "
"ostendentur ut antea--cum aedificium minus quam 100% punctorum valetudinis "
"habet."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Town and Firm information panels will show the number of spies you have "
"inside of them instead of just \"(Spy)\".  If the general is also your spy, "
"it will say \"G+\" the number of other spies you have."
msgstr ""
"Tabulae informationum oppidorum et aedificiorum numerum speculatorum quos "
"intus habes ostendent, non modo «(Speculator)». Si dux quoque speculator "
"tuus est, «D+» cum numero ceterorum speculatorum ostendetur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.2.5 -- 2025-09-09"
msgstr "v3.2.5 -- 2025-09-09"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added scrolling with the mouse wheel, up/down, and home/end keys to the "
"Harbour ship list."
msgstr ""
"Adiectae sunt scrollingo cum rota muris, sursum/down, et domus/extremae "
"claves portus indicem navis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added ship count and capacity display to Harbours on the info pane."
msgstr ""
"Addita est ostensio numeri et capacitatis navium ad Portus in tabella "
"informationum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added $100,000 throne purchase option."
msgstr "Solo $100,000 optionem emptionis addidit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed building menus (Town training, Harbour/War Factory build, spy menus, "
"etc.) exiting back to the main menu when production of a new unit starts."
msgstr ""
"Correcti sunt indices aedificiorum (exercitatio Oppidi, aedificatio Portus/"
"Officinae Belli, indices speculatoris, etc.) qui ad indicem principalem "
"redibant cum productio novae unitatis incipiebat."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed a crash when looking at the ship list on the trade report."
msgstr ""
"Fragorem fixum cum indicem tabulae navis in commercium relatu spectabat."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Start the kingdom score comparison with your own kingdom selected by "
"default.  You can deselect it or select another kingdom by clicking the "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Incipe in regnum ustulo comparatio cum regnum electo defalta.  Eum deselect "
"vel alium regnum strepitando deprimendo potes eligere."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the per-unit and total costs when choosing how to respond to food "
"purchase requests."
msgstr ""
"Ostende per-unitatem et summas impensas eligens quomodo respondere ad "
"petitiones emptionis cibi."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Use thousands separators for throne purchase amounts options."
msgstr "Millibus separators utere pro throno amounts optiones emptionis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.2.4 -- 2025-09-03"
msgstr "v3.2.4 -- 2025-09-03"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added kingdom-to-kingdom score comparison to the Rank Report, allowing you "
"to see the scores of two kingdoms side-by-side."
msgstr ""
"Addita est comparatio punctorum inter regna ad Relationem Ordinis, ut puncta "
"duorum regnorum iuxta videre possis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Independent towns will show that their resistance is dropping to 0 when they "
"are working for you."
msgstr ""
"Oppida independentia ostendent eorum resistentia cadere in 0 cum tibi "
"operantur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added scrolling with the mouse wheel, up/down, home/end, and pg up/down keys "
"to the scenario selection list and description."
msgstr ""
"Adiectae sunt scrollingo rotae muris, sursum/down, domus/finis, et pg sursum/"
"proci claves missionis delectu et descriptione."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the estimated assassination success chance not properly taking into "
"account other defenders present, showing too high when other units were "
"present."
msgstr ""
"Successus possibilitas aestimatam caedem non recte attentis statuit alios "
"defensores praesentes esse, cum ceterae unitates aderant nimis altam "
"ostendens."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the estimated assassination success chance against a king being too "
"low."
msgstr "Contra rex humilis successus aestimatam necem possibilitas statuit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the estimated assassination success chance being too low based on the "
"spy skill."
msgstr ""
"Existimationis homicidii successus possibilitas premens ex ars speculator "
"statuit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the production queue sizes showing the wrong number when training a "
"unit finishes."
msgstr ""
"Certae magnitudinis productio queue ostendens numerum iniuriam cum "
"disciplina unitas finiatur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the production queue size display bouncing down and up in multiplayer "
"when a unit starts production."
msgstr ""
"Fixum est productionem queue magnitudine ostentationis proiectionis et "
"sursum in pluribus lusoribus cum productionis unitas incipit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the build Seat of Power keybind (P) not working because it was "
"conflicting with toggling opaque report mode.  The default keybind for "
"toggling opaque report mode has been cleared.  You can re-enable the keybind "
"with the `KEYEVENT_ _REPORT_ _OPAQUE_ _TOGGLE` event, with a different key, "
"in the config.txt file."
msgstr ""
"Correcta est clavis (P) ad Sedem Potestatis aedificandam quae non operabatur "
"quia cum commutatione modi opaci relationis pugnabat. Clavis praedefinita ad "
"modum opacum relationis commutandum deleta est. Clavem rursus instituere "
"potes eventu `KEYEVENT_ _REPORT_ _OPAQUE_ _TOGGLE`, cum diversa clave, in "
"fasciculo config.txt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the war machine type and level identifiers inside forts causing "
"artefacts when they moved around in the list."
msgstr ""
"Bellum machinae genus et gradus identificatores intra castella artificia "
"faciens, cum in indice circumagerent, statuit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed possible crashes when pasting text containing characters unprintable "
"by the game."
msgstr ""
"Certum est possibilis fragores, cum textus praeteriens continens characteres "
"inexplicabiles per ludum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug where loading and unloading a scenario would cause multiplayer "
"to stop working."
msgstr ""
"Fixum est cimex ubi missionem loading et exonerandi causa lusoribus cessandi "
"laboravit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash where loading and unloading a scenario and then loading and "
"unloading a scenario again would crash the game."
msgstr ""
"Certum est fragorem ubi missionem onerantium et exonerationem exonerat ac "
"deinde missionem onerabat et exonerabat iterumque ludum collidebat."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Shifted the bitmaps of Firms to better align with the squares they actually "
"take up so that they look more on-centre, especially the Seats of Power."
msgstr ""
"Mutata bitmaps Firmorum ad melius align cum quadratis actu suscipiunt ut "
"magis centrum, praesertim Sedes Potestatis, inspiciant."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Shifted the bitmaps of Fryhtan Lairs to better align with the squares they "
"actually take up so that they look more on-centre, especially the Wyrm and "
"Ick ones."
msgstr ""
"Imagines bitmap Latibulorum Fryhtanorum motae sunt, ut melius quadratis quae "
"re vera occupant congruant atque magis in medio positae videantur, "
"praesertim illae Wyrmi et Ick."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Changed the graphics of Standard tileset terrain that looked like it should "
"block building and movement but didn't, and vice versa, so that it's now "
"obvious by just looking at it."
msgstr ""
"Tegularum tegularum figurarum Latinarum mutavit, quae quasi defensio "
"aedificationis motusque videri debet, sed non, et vice versa, ita ut nunc "
"aspicientibus modo patet."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Adjusted the graphics of Standard tileset terrain that looked like it should "
"allow building and movement around its corners and edges but didn't, so that "
"it's now obvious by just looking that it's not."
msgstr ""
"Tegularum tegularum graphicarum graphicarum rerum adaequatum est, quod "
"simile videri debet aedificare et movere circa angulos eius et oras, sed non "
"facere, ut nunc manifestus sit modo vultus non esse."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Reworked the assassination chance estimate calculation to better take into "
"account the possibility or lack of enemy spies."
msgstr ""
"Retractavit sicarius possibilitas calculi aestimationem ut melius consideret "
"speculatores possibilitatis vel defectus hostis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Disabled the caravan clone button (and remove it in the trade report) for "
"idle caravans, since trying to clone them does nothing anyway."
msgstr ""
"Debilitavit puga viatores clone (et removere in commercium relatu) in "
"caravanis otiosis, cum eos clone conari nihil usquam agit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Changed default keybind for train soldier to `F` from `W`, to make it more "
"consistent with the other fort-related keybinds (build fort)."
msgstr ""
"Mutata defalta clavis ligaturae ad miles agmen ad `F` a `W`, ut magis "
"consentaneum sit cum aliis nexibus castelli relatis (castrum aedificandum)."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Swapped the default keybinds for same kingdom/any kingdom object switching "
"keybinds (`,`/`.` and `<`/`>`), to make it easier to do the more common task "
"(switching between units of the same kingdom) without holding they shift key."
msgstr ""
"Defaltam clavium ligaturae pro eisdem regnum/quaevis obiecti regnum "
"permutationis clavium (`,`/`.` et `<`/`>`), ut facilius negotium communius "
"(transmutatio inter unitates eiusdem regnum) non tenentes clavem transferant."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Adjusted the page scrolling on the save game list to keep one item on the "
"page, so that it's evident that it's scrolling only one page at a time."
msgstr ""
"Accommodata est volutatio paginae in indice ludorum servatorum ut unum "
"elementum in pagina maneat, ut pateat eam unam tantum paginam simul volvere."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Break up the 7K:AA changelog entries into categories, thanks to a poster on "
"Discord, to make it easier to read."
msgstr ""
"Conteri 7K:AA changelog entries in categorias, gratias a poster in "
"Discordia, ut facilius legatur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.2.3 -- 2025-08-24"
msgstr "v3.2.3 -- 2025-08-24"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show a Spy-suggested bribe amount on the bribe menu.  This amount varies in "
"accuracy over time and based on the spy's skill.  But keep in mind that your "
"spies do not know about enemy spies."
msgstr ""
"Ostenditur summa corruptionis a Speculatore suggesta in indice corruptionis. "
"Haec summa accuratione variat per tempus et secundum peritiam speculatoris. "
"Sed memento speculatores tuos de speculatoribus hostis nescire."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added an assassination confirmation screen with a Spy-estimated success "
"chance.  This estimate varies in accuracy over time and based on the spy's "
"skill."
msgstr ""
"Addidit sicarios confirmationis velum cum victoria possibilitas speculator "
"aestimata.  Haec aestimatio accurate per tempus variatur et in ars "
"speculatoris fundatur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added a steal report confirmation screen with a Spy-estimated escape "
"chance.  This estimate varies in accuracy over time and based on the spy's "
"skill."
msgstr ""
"Addidit relationem furandi velum confirmationis cum effugium speculatorum "
"aestimatum possibilitas.  Haec aestimatio accurate per tempus variatur et in "
"ars speculatoris fundatur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the surplus (or deficit) number of peasants that you have on the "
"Villages Report.  This is how many extra peasants you currently have over "
"the amount you need to exactly balance food production and consumption."
msgstr ""
"Ostende superfluum (vel defuerit) numerum rusticorum quem habes in "
"Renuntiatione Pagi.  Hoc est quot extra rusticos quos hodie habes supra "
"quantum debes ad cibum productionis et consummationis exacte libratum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Increased bribe choices to include $2500 and $3500."
msgstr "Praemium auctus electiones includit $ MMD et $ MMMD."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added more food purchasing quantity and price options."
msgstr "Plus cibi adiecerunt emendi quantitatem et pretium optiones."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added more aid and tribute amount options."
msgstr "Adiecerunt plura subsidia et tributa optionum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed build guidelines not being clearly visible on Snow and Badlands "
"tilesets."
msgstr ""
"Certae normae constructae non clare conspicuae in tegulis Nivis et Badlandis "
"sunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed some build guidelines appearing a different colour on top of "
"highlighting."
msgstr ""
"Certa quaedam guidelines constructum alium colorem apparentem super "
"illuminatione."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Fixed the Villages Report yearly Firm costs, Military Report yearly Unit "
"costs, and War Machine yearly costs showing up 10% higher than actual, now "
"that the day accounting bug has been fixed and reduced these costs again."
msgstr ""
"Correcti sunt sumptus annui Firmarum in Relatione Vicorum, sumptus annui "
"unitatum in Relatione Militari, et sumptus annui Machinarum Bellicarum, qui "
"10% altiores quam revera apparebant, postquam vitium rationis diurnae "
"correctum est et hos sumptus rursus minuit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed save file names and dates running off on the right side of the load "
"screen, creating artefacts.  This was especially problematic in some non-"
"English languages where the text is wider or longer."
msgstr ""
"Certa nomina nisi fasciculi et dies decurrentes in dextra parte tegumentum "
"oneris, artificia faciendi.  Hoc praecipue problematicum fuit in nonnullis "
"linguis non-anglicis ubi textus latior vel longior est."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash when selling or demolishing an empty Fort which has a rally "
"point."
msgstr ""
"Certum est fragorem, quando vendendi vel demoliendi vacuum propugnaculum "
"est, quod concursum est."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed Spy steal report escape chances not actually depending on the type of "
"report stolen.  Now, different report types will have different chances of "
"escape after stealing them."
msgstr ""
"Certum Speculator fu- perat famae effugium casus haud actu pendens typum "
"famae furtivae.  Nunc, diversae famae genera, diversos evasionis casus "
"surripientes habebunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed save game list scrolling further than expected."
msgstr ""
"Correcta est volutatio indicis ludorum servatorum quae longius quam "
"exspectabatur procedebat."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug where a ghost guest in an Inn could cause a segmentation fault "
"crash."
msgstr ""
"Cimex fixa ubi hospita spectrum in Deversorium causare potuit ruinam "
"segmentationis culpae."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed dying units always showing the outside-leadership-range icon."
msgstr ""
"Unitates morientes fixae semper iconem extra ducturam-iactus ostendentes."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Made the build guidelines on the Standard tileset slightly brighter, to make "
"them more visible."
msgstr ""
"Edificandi lineas in tegulis vexilliferis paulo clariora fecit, ut eas magis "
"conspicuas redderet."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Hide icons for units that are dying."
msgstr "Icones celare pro unitates quae moriuntur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Lined up the villager and peasant numbers on the Villages Report."
msgstr "Instruxit numeros rustici et vicani in Pagi Report."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Show the per-unit and total costs of food purchase requests."
msgstr "Ostende per-unitatem et summas expensas cibi emptionis petitiones."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Increased the game speed of the unlimited speed by not drawing every frame, "
"but only 60 FPS."
msgstr ""
"Ludum celeritas illimitatum celeritas auxit, non omnes artus trahendo, sed "
"tantum 60 FPS."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Use thousands separators for food purchase quantities and aid and tribute "
"amounts."
msgstr ""
"Millia separators utuntur ad cibum acquirunt quantitatibus et auxiliis ac "
"tributis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.2.2 -- 2025-08-18"
msgstr "v3.2.2 -- 2025-08-18"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "No game changes.  This just has packaging changes to work with Gentoo."
msgstr ""
"Non ludus mutationes.  Hoc modo packaging mutationes ad operandum cum Gentoo "
"habet."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.2.1 -- 2025-08-12"
msgstr "v3.2.1 -- 2025-08-12"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added keybinds and keybind display to Town training menu buttons.  The "
"events for the config.txt file are: `KEYEVENT_ _TRAIN_ _BUILDER`, `KEYEVENT_ "
"_TRAIN_ _SOLDIER`, `KEYEVENT_ _TRAIN_ _MINER`, `KEYEVENT_ _TRAIN_ _ARTISAN`, "
"`KEYEVENT_ _TRAIN_ _RESEARCHER`, and `KEYEVENT_ _TRAIN_ _SPY`."
msgstr ""
"Additae sunt claves compendiariae et earum ostentatio ad bullas indicis "
"exercitationis Oppidi. Eventus pro fasciculo config.txt sunt: `KEYEVENT_ "
"_TRAIN_ _BUILDER`, `KEYEVENT_ _TRAIN_ _SOLDIER`, `KEYEVENT_ _TRAIN_ _MINER`, "
"`KEYEVENT_ _TRAIN_ _ARTISAN`, `KEYEVENT_ _TRAIN_ _RESEARCHER`, et `KEYEVENT_ "
"_TRAIN_ _SPY`."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added keybinds and keybind display to Spy menu buttons.  The events for the "
"config.txt file are: `KEYEVENT_ _UNIT_ _REWARD`, `KEYEVENT_ _SPY_ "
"_ASSASSINATE`, `KEYEVENT_ _SPY_ _BRIBE`, `KEYEVENT_ _SPY_ _CAPTURE`, "
"`KEYEVENT_ _SPY_ _CHANGE_ _MISSION`, `KEYEVENT_ _SPY_ _MOBILISE`, `KEYEVENT_ "
"_SPY_ _MENU`, and `KEYEVENT_ _SPY_ _STEAL_ _REPORTS`."
msgstr ""
"Additae sunt claves compendiariae et earum ostentatio ad bullas indicis "
"speculatoris. Eventus pro fasciculo config.txt sunt: `KEYEVENT_ _UNIT_ "
"_REWARD`, `KEYEVENT_ _SPY_ _ASSASSINATE`, `KEYEVENT_ _SPY_ _BRIBE`, "
"`KEYEVENT_ _SPY_ _CAPTURE`, `KEYEVENT_ _SPY_ _CHANGE_ _MISSION`, `KEYEVENT_ "
"_SPY_ _MOBILISE`, `KEYEVENT_ _SPY_ _MENU`, et `KEYEVENT_ _SPY_ _STEAL_ "
"_REPORTS`."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added a keybind for mobilising all workers in a building.  This uses the "
"existing event of `KEYEVENT_ _FIRM_ _PATROL` (defaults to `R`)."
msgstr ""
"Clavis ligamen ad omnes operarios in aedificium movens addidit.  Hic utitur "
"eventu exsistenti `KEYEVENT_ _FIRM_ _PATROL` (defaltis ad `R`)."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Load 7kaa's config.txt file as well as Ambition's one, to reduce the need "
"for duplication.  Settings in Ambition's config.txt override those is 7kaa's "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Aperitur fasciculus config.txt ipsius 7kaa una cum eo Ambitionis, ut minus "
"duplicatione opus sit. Occasus in config.txt Ambitionis eos in config.txt "
"7kaa supersedent."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added Discord and feedback links to the main menu, in the bottom-left corner."
msgstr ""
"Nexus ad Discord et ad responsiones in indice principali, in angulo "
"inferiore sinistro, additi sunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added keybinds for starting a new single-player game (`KEYEVENT_ _CONFIRM`) "
"and for going back (`KEYEVENT_ _CANCEL`)."
msgstr ""
"Claviculationes additae ad novum lusorem lusorium ( `KEYEVENT_ _CONFIRM`) "
"incipiendum et ad rediendum (`KEYEVENT_ _CANCEL`)."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed leadership status artefacts on the info pane when the status changes."
msgstr ""
"Correcta sunt vitia visualia status ductus in tabella informationum cum "
"status mutatur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed spies seemingly always getting caught after stealing reports."
msgstr "Certi speculatores videntur semper rapti post furtum rumores."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fixed spies having a 100% escape chance when stealing reports."
msgstr ""
"Speculatores fixi habentes pro 100% effugium possibilitas cum tradit furtum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Made the keybind displays appear transparent over their buttons, to obscure "
"less of the underlying buttons."
msgstr ""
"Ostensiones ligaturae factae super globulis eorum perspicuae apparent, minus "
"obscurae ex globulis subiectarum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Enabled default hotkeys for the build menu and disabled default `Q`, `W`, "
"and `E` for selecting map modes.  The new default `E` now cycles through all "
"of the map modes; and `W` is the default hotkey for building a War Factory.  "
"This can all be overridden in the config.txt file."
msgstr ""
"Institutae sunt claves compendiariae praedefinitae pro indice aedificandi et "
"abrogatae sunt praedefinitae `Q`, `W`, et `E` ad modos tabulae seligendos. "
"Nova praedefinita `E` nunc per omnes modos tabulae circumit; et `W` est "
"clavis praedefinita ad Officinam Belli aedificandam. Haec omnia in fasciculo "
"config.txt supersederi possunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Changed the default hotkeys for next/previous object to `.`, `,`, `shift+.`, "
"and `shift+,`, so that they do not conflict with scrolling."
msgstr ""
"Mutatae sunt claves compendiariae praedefinitae pro obiecto proximo/"
"praecedenti in `.`, `,`, `shift+.`, et `shift+,`, ne cum volutatione pugnent."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Reduced the brightness of the building guide lines from bright white, so "
"that they're less jarring."
msgstr ""
"Ductor lineae ex candido splendorem aedificii redegerunt, ut minus "
"horribiles."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Only ask for feedback about once a month, instead of every time."
msgstr "Tantum rogas opiniones de semel in mense, pro omni tempore."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Treat config.txt lines which begin with `#ambition` as actual settings "
"(ignoring the `#ambition` part and using the rest of the line) instead of "
"comments.  This allows sharing of configs with 7kaa without worrying about "
"Ambition settings not being recognised by 7kaa."
msgstr ""
"Lineae config.txt quae a `#ambition` incipiunt ut veri occasus tractantur "
"(parte `#ambition` neglecta et reliqua linea adhibita) loco commentariorum. "
"Hoc permittit configurationes cum 7kaa communicare sine cura ne occasus "
"Ambitionis a 7kaa non agnoscantur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Split local data into multiple directories, to make finding what you need "
"easier: `config`, `screenshot`, `save/singleplayer`, and `save/"
"multiplayer`.  Existing files in the base directory will be migrated to "
"their appropriate location."
msgstr ""
"Data localia in plures directoria divisa sunt, ut quod opus est facilius "
"inveniatur: `config`, `screenshot`, `save/singleplayer`, et `save/"
"multiplayer`. Fasciculi exsistentes in directorio basis ad locum suum aptum "
"transferentur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Start playing music straight away on the What's New screen instead of only "
"on the main menu, to give the right atmosphere.  The usual settings for "
"music and volume are respected."
msgstr ""
"Incipe musicam continuo in screen Quid Novum loco tantum in elencho "
"principali, ad dextram atmosphaeram dare.  Sollemnes occasus pro musica et "
"volumine servantur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Tweak the wording of the feedback request pop-up buttons."
msgstr "Verba bullarum fenestellae quae sententiam poscit leviter mutata sunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.2.0 -- 2025-08-10"
msgstr "v3.2.0 -- 2025-08-10"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"This is a 7kaa-compatibility release.  7kaa recently released a new version "
"(2.15.7), and this merges in those changes, and adds a few fixes."
msgstr ""
"Haec emissio compatibilitas 7kaa-est.  7kaa nuper novam versionem emisit "
"(2.15.7), et haec migrat in his mutationibus et paucas fixiones addit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "See the below sections for more details."
msgstr "Vide infra sectiones ad plura."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the oversized Town training buttons and the artefacts they caused on "
"the info pane."
msgstr ""
"Correctae sunt bullae exercitationis Oppidi nimis magnae et vitia visualia "
"quae in tabella informationum efficiebant."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed the file time display of old save game files."
msgstr "Antiquum tempus ostentationis fixa tabella ludorum servandum curavit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed incorrect and misplaced field labels for Workers in the info pane."
msgstr ""
"Correctae sunt inscriptiones camporum pro Operariis falsae et male "
"collocatae in tabella informationum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed Inn scrolling not showing lower guests when there are more than 4 "
"guests."
msgstr ""
"Correcta est volutatio Deversorii quae inferiores hospites non ostendebat "
"cum plus quam 4 hospites adsunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed config.txt settings for `KEYEVENT_ _CANCEL` and `KEYEVENT_ _CONFIRM` "
"not working."
msgstr ""
"Correcti sunt occasus config.txt pro `KEYEVENT_ _CANCEL` et `KEYEVENT_ "
"_CONFIRM` qui non operabantur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Removed the clone button for ships on the Trade Report, which causes a crash "
"and was not meant to be put in yet.  (Cloning ships is a planned featured to "
"be added later.)"
msgstr ""
"Bulla clone navium in Commercium Relatione removit, quae fragorem creat et "
"nondum destinatum erat.  (De navibus exquisitis postea addendus est)"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Updated 7kaa compatibility to the recently-released 7kaa 2.15.7 (see below "
"for more details about the update)."
msgstr ""
"Renovata 7kaa compatibilitas cum 7kaa 2.15.7 recens dimissi (vide infra pro "
"magis details de renovatione)."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "7K:AA [2.15.7] -- 2025-07-25"
msgstr "7K:AA [2.15.7] -- 2025-07-25"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Improvements from Ambition"
msgstr "Meliorationes ex Ambitione"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Allow comments in config.txt (lines starting with `#`)."
msgstr "Commentarii in config.txt permittuntur (lineae a `#` incipientes)."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed requested builder sometimes being unable to reach destination."
msgstr "Certum petitum architecto interdum destinatum attingere non valens."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Correct day counting."
msgstr "Recta dies numerandi."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed high-potential soldiers gaining less leadership."
msgstr "Certa summus miles potentiae minus principatum obtinet."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed unit skill potential to persist, and not continually be randomised"
msgstr "Unitas certa ars potentialis perseverare, nec continue temere fieri"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed issues with skills being reset when entering buildings"
