#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Changed (UI)"
msgstr "Mutatus (UI)"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Improved mouse wheel scrolling"
msgstr "Volutatio rota muris emendata est"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Increased max screenshot file limit."
msgstr "Auctus est modus screenshots max."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Changed (AI)"
msgstr "Mutata (AI)"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Improved detection of the likely target nation of an attack"
msgstr "Melior deprehensio probabilis scopo nationis impetus"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Improved ai management of firms"
msgstr "Administratio firmarum ab AI emendata est"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Improved ai in managing town capture operations"
msgstr "AI in operationibus oppidorum capiendorum administrandis emendata est"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Ensured AI checks worker skills in management actions."
msgstr "Curae AI in actionibus administrationis artes artifices compescit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Adjusted AI to avoid accepting treaties from large rivals."
msgstr "AI accommodatum ne foedera ab aemulis magnis accipiant."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Prioritized higher-skilled generals and combat-level soldiers in management."
msgstr ""
"Praepositos duces et pugnae-gradus milites in administratione superiores "
"peritos."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Changed (General)"
msgstr "Mutatus (Dux)"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Allowed the scenario settings to persist across save and load"
msgstr "Permisit sem occasus persistere per nisi et onus"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Improved caravan/caraval trade stop logic"
msgstr "Ratio melioris ad curruum/caravalium commercium sistendum"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Improved manual and added a cover."
msgstr "Enchiridion emendavit et operculum addidit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Improved multi-language support"
msgstr "Auxilium multilingue emendatum est"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Increased the speed of the 9th speed level"
msgstr "Auxit celeritas Domini noni celeritas gradus"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.1.10 -- 2025-07-05"
msgstr "v3.1.10 -- 2025-07-05"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added save/load game list scrolling with the mouse wheel or touchpad, up/"
"down keys, pg up/pg down keys, left/right keys, and home/end keys."
msgstr ""
"Addita est volutatio indicis ludorum servandorum/onerandorum rota muris vel "
"tabella tactili, clavibus sursum/deorsum, paginae sursum/deorsum, sinistra/"
"dextra, et initii/finis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added news scrolling with the mouse wheel or touchpad, up/down keys, pg up/"
"pg down keys, left/right keys, and home/end keys."
msgstr ""
"Addita est volutatio nuntiorum rota muris vel tabella tactili, clavibus "
"sursum/deorsum, paginae sursum/deorsum, sinistra/dextra, et initii/finis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added scrolling with the mouse wheel or touchpad, up/down keys, pg up/pg "
"down keys, left/right keys, and home/end keys to the Kingdoms, Villages, "
"Economy, Trade, Military, Technology, Espionage, and Raking reports."
msgstr ""
"Additae sunt volvendi facultates cum rota muris vel tabula tactili, clavibus "
"sursum/deorsum, clavibus pg sursum/pg deorsum, clavibus sinistra/dextra, et "
"clavibus domi/finis ad relationes Regnorum, Vicorum, Oeconomiae, Commercii, "
"Militum, Technologiae, Speculationis, et Raking."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added Inn guest list scrolling with the mouse wheel or touchpad and up/down "
"and home/end keys."
msgstr ""
"Addita est volutatio indicis hospitum Deversorii rota muris vel tabella "
"tactili et clavibus sursum/deorsum et initii/finis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added spy list scrolling with the mouse wheel or touchpad, up/down keys, pg "
"up/pg down keys, left/right keys, and home/end keys."
msgstr ""
"Addita est volutatio indicis speculatorum rota muris vel tabella tactili, "
"clavibus sursum/deorsum, paginae sursum/deorsum, sinistra/dextra, et initii/"
"finis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added ctrl+click priority builder request to request the nearest builder, "
"ignoring all optimisations and what the nearest builder is doing (except "
"constructing a new building).  Even if the builder request icon is not "
"visible, holding Control will make it appear if there is at least one "
"builder who could walk there."
msgstr ""
"Addita est postulatio prioritaria aedificatoris per pressionem cum Ctrl, ut "
"proximus aedificator petatur, omnibus optimizationibus et opere eius "
"praetermissis (nisi novum aedificium construit).  Etiamsi imago petitionis "
"aedificatoris non apparet, Ctrl tenere eam ostendet, si saltem unus "
"aedificator illuc ire potest."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Show war machine yearly upkeep and attack range in the info pane."
msgstr ""
"Ostenduntur sumptus annui machinae bellicae et spatium impetus in tabella "
"informationum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Show the Inn guests that will be leaving soon (within 20 days)."
msgstr "Monstra Deversorium hospites mox abeuntes (infra 20 dies)."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added ctrl+click to mobilise workers from a building before selling or "
"demolishing it."
msgstr ""
"Addita est pressio cum Ctrl ad operarios ex aedificio convocandos antequam "
"id vendatur aut diruatur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added Town race list scrolling with the mouse wheel or touchpad, up/down "
"keys, pg up/pg down keys, left/right keys, and home/end keys."
msgstr ""
"Addita est volutatio indicis gentium Oppidi rota muris vel tabella tactili, "
"clavibus sursum/deorsum, paginae sursum/deorsum, sinistra/dextra, et initii/"
"finis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added scroll up and scroll down prompts to the What's New screen."
msgstr ""
"Volumen additae sunt et volumen deorsum suggerunt in scrinii Quid Novum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added scroll hints to the What's New screen."
msgstr "Volumen additae innuit in scrinii Quid Novum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed crash when requesting a builder while training one in a Town."
msgstr "Certum fragorem petens structorem dum exercet unum in Oppido."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed a desync on selling a fort with soldiers or a general in it in "
"multiplayer."
msgstr ""
"Desync fixum fuit quod in pluribus lusoribus castellum venderet cum "
"militibus vel dux."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed Inn selected guest changing when another one leaves."
msgstr "Fixum Deversorium lectus hospitem mutans cum alius unum relinquit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed the build marker flashing too fast."
msgstr "Statuit edificandi titulum micans nimis celeriter."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed items sometimes showing up under the wrong heading on the What's New "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"Certae res interdum ostendens sub titulo iniuriae in screen Quid Novum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the building guide lines not reaching the top and right edges of the "
"viewport."
msgstr ""
"Dux aedificationis lineas constituit non attingens ad summum et dextrum "
"margines speculationis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Display the contribution value in the info pane exactly as it relates to "
"total reward and loyalty (the true effect on loyalty is the newly displayed "
"contribution value minus the reward value)."
msgstr ""
"Ostenditur valor collationis in tabella informationum prout ad totum "
"praemium et fidem refertur (verus effectus in fidem est valor collationis "
"noviter ostensus minus valore praemii)."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Prevent accidentally hiring the wrong Inn guest if the currently selected "
"guest leaves the Inn by disabling the hire button until another selection is "
"made."
msgstr ""
"Prohibetur ne per imprudentiam falsus hospes Deversorii conducatur, si "
"hospes nunc selectus Deversorium relinquit, bulla conducendi inhabili "
"reddita donec alia selectio fiat."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Made the no leader assigned message more obvious by adding \"assigned\"."
msgstr ""
"Nuntium nullum ducem adsignatum manifestiorem fecit addendo \"assignatum\"."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.1.9 -- 2025-06-25"
msgstr "v3.1.9 -- 2025-06-25"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed save game filenames being all underscores."
msgstr "Fixum ludum filenames salvum esse omnia underscores."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.1.8 -- 2025-06-23"
msgstr "v3.1.8 -- 2025-06-23"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added a clone button to Caravans.  If there is an idle Caravan, it is used "
"as the clone.  Otherwise, a new Caravan spawns at the Market closest to the "
"Caravan's first stop."
msgstr ""
"Addidit clone puga Caravanae.  Si sit otiosus Caravana, usurpatur pro "
"clone.  Alioquin nova Caravana in Forum proximae primae statio Caravane "
"pariit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added a caravan clone button to the trade report, next to the paste route "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Addidit puga viatores clone ad commercium relacionem, iuxta bullam viae "
"crustulum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Automatically \"heal\" caravans by replacing damaged ones using the above "
"caravan cloning feature.  Caravans heading to a Market will be replaced if "
"they have any damage, and caravans which do not have any Market stops will "
"be replaced if they fall to 80% or below."
msgstr ""
"Caravanae laesae automatice \"sanantur\" novis substitutae, per facultatem "
"clonandi supra descriptam.  Caravanae ad Forum tendentes, si ullum damnum "
"habent, restituentur; caravanae autem quae stationes Fori non habent "
"restituentur si ad 80% vel infra cadant."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the skill icon of the unit being trained in Towns under the progress "
"bar on the world map and in the info pane."
msgstr ""
"Ostenditur imago peritiae unitatis quae in Oppidis exercetur sub virga "
"progressus in tabula mundi et in tabella informationum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Show the skill level of builders inside buildings on the hammer icon."
msgstr "Ostende ars gradus aedificantium intra aedificiorum iconem in malleus."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the Town training icon in the info pane not appearing until clicking "
"on the Town again and disappearing after one unit finishes training."
msgstr ""
"Correcta est imago exercitationis Oppidi in tabella informationum quae non "
"apparebat donec Oppidum iterum premeretur et evanescebat postquam una unitas "
"exerceri desinebat."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed high CPU usage on the \"Enter the game's address\" dialog."
msgstr "Summum fixum CPU usum in \"Intra inscriptione ludi\" dialogum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed graphics corruption when hiring units from inns in multiplayer."
msgstr ""
"Graphics fixa corruptio cum unitates ex diversoriis in lusoribus conducendis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed graphics corruption with disabled buttons."
msgstr "Fixarum graphics corruptio cum globulis debilibus."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed memory violation with building guides."
msgstr "Memoriae certae violationis cum ducibus aedificandis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Preferentially use idle builders outside of buildings further away instead "
"of from closer buildings."
msgstr ""
"Potius utimur otiosis structoribus extra edificiis longius loco ab arctiore "
"aedificiis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Moved the \"Done\" text to the right in the War Factory and Harbour build "
"menus, so that they are not covered up by the \"Esc\" keybind display."
msgstr ""
"Movit textum \"Actum\" ad dextram in Officina Belli et Harbour menus "
"aedificandi, ita ut per \"Esc\" ligamen propono non obtectae sint."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Use lower case for default save filenames, based on the king's name."
msgstr "Utere causa inferiore pro defalta nisi filenamiis, innixa nomine rex."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.1.7 -- 2025-06-13"
msgstr "v3.1.7 -- 2025-06-13"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug where opening the military report before setting a global "
"research target could cause a crash when a Tower of Science was built "
"afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Cimex fixus est ubi relatio militaris aperiens antequam scopum investigatio "
"moveret globalem fragorem causare potuit cum Scientiae Turris postea "
"aedificata est."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.1.6 -- 2025-05-28"
msgstr "v3.1.6 -- 2025-05-28"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"When selecting where to place a building, show grid rules of the building, "
"and grid rules one tile out, for a walkable perimeter, to allow for easier "
"placement and planning of buildings."
msgstr ""
"Cum seligendis ubi aedificium collocandum, normas aedificiorum adhibeas, et "
"eget regulam unam tegulam, ad ambulandum ambitum, ut faciliori collocatione "
"et consilio aedificiorum concedat."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"When selecting where to place a building, highlight valid locations, darken "
"invalid locations, and shade un-walkable locations red, to create a guide "
"for placing and planning buildings.  This is especially helpful with "
"Harbours."
msgstr ""
"Cum seligendis ubi aedificium collocare, loca valida exaggerare, loca "
"invalida obscurare, et loca rubra un- walkable obscurare, ducem edificiorum "
"collocandi ac disponendi creare.  Hoc in portubus maxime prodest."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Highlight possible Harbour locations brighter when they can link to other "
"buildings, to allow for easier placement of buildings."
msgstr ""
"Exaggeratio portus locorum clarior fieri potest cum aliis aedificiis "
"coniungi possunt, ut facilius locatio aedificiorum patiantur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Highlight possible Seat of Power locations brighter when they are away from "
"Towns, to allow for planning so that they do not take up space that can be "
"used by buildings that do link to Towns."
msgstr ""
"Highlight possibilis Sedes Potestatis locis clariora cum ab Oppidis absunt, "
"ut consilium sinerent ut spatium non capiant quae aedificiis quae Oppidis "
"coniungunt possunt adhiberi."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Highlight possible Inn locations brighter when they are away from Towns and "
"other Inns, to allow for planning so that they do not take up space that can "
"be used by buildings that do link to Towns and so that Inns do not get the "
"proximity penalty."
msgstr ""
"Highlight possible Deversorium locis clarioribus cum ab oppidis et aliis "
"Inns absunt, consilium sinere ut spatium non capiant quae aedificiis "
"adhiberi possunt quae cum Oppidis coniungunt et ne Inns propinquitatem poena "
"non obtinent."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Highlight possible locations for other buildings brighter when they can link "
"to other buildings, to allow for easier placement and planning of buildings."
msgstr ""
"Loca lucida esse possunt ad alia aedificia clariora cum aliis aedificiis "
"coniungi possunt, ut facilius locatio et ratio aedificiorum patiantur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the per-unit and total costs, along with the percentages of the fixed "
"expense, for units on the Military Report."
msgstr ""
"Ostende per-unitatem et summas impensas, una cum recipis sumptuum fixarum, "
"pro unitates in Relatione Militaria."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show a total for the unit costs, along with the percentage of fixed expense, "
"on the Military Report."
msgstr ""
"Monstrare totalem pro expensis unitatis, cum recipis impensis certarum, in "
"Relatione Militaria."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added a keybind for confirming in saving and loading menus (defaults to "
"Enter), settable in config.txt with `bindkey = KEYEVENT_ _CONFIRM,Return`."
msgstr ""
"Addita est clavis ad confirmandum in indicibus servandi et onerandi "
"(praedefinita ad Enter), in config.txt ponenda per `bindkey = KEYEVENT_ "
"_CONFIRM,Return`."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added the KEYEVENT_ _CONFIRM keybind to mode selection screen for confirming "
"the selection using the Enter key (by default)."
msgstr ""
"Addita est clavis KEYEVENT_ _CONFIRM ad velum selectionis modi ad "
"selectionem clave Enter confirmandam (ex praedefinito)."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the building expense amounts on the Villages report being lower than "
"the real expense."
msgstr ""
"Sumptuum aedificationis fixum summas in Pagis referunt, inferiores esse quam "
"sumptu reali."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed spy icon getting duplicated when workers are re-arranged inside "
"buildings."
msgstr ""
"Speculator fixum iconem questus duplicavit cum operarii intus aedificia re- "
"disposita."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed raw material (and other) icons showing with a white background."
msgstr "Materiae rudis fixae (et aliae) icones exhibentes cum involucro albo."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed potential incorrect placement and crash with user interface bounds."
msgstr ""
"Fixa potentiale falsa collocatio et fragor cum terminis interfaciei usoris."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Sortie troops from Forts before selling or destroying them, so that the "
"troops still count as being under the general's leadership."
msgstr ""
"Praetoriae ex castellis antequam eas venderent vel destruerent, copiae adhuc "
"numerabantur sub duce dux."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"When a new builder enters a building under construction, the knocked-out "
"builder will get sent to the building's rally point.  The same applies to "
"builders ejected by pressing the hammer button."
msgstr ""
"Cum novus aedificator aedificium constructione intraverit, aedificator "
"pulsans ad punctum societatis aedificationis mittetur.  Eadem ratio est "
"aedificatoribus eiectis premendo bullam malleus."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.1.5 -- 2025-05-03"
msgstr "v3.1.5 -- 2025-05-03"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Show building construction costs on buttons."
msgstr "Monstrare constructionem sumptuum in globulis construendis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show war machine and ship construction costs on War Factory and Harbour "
"build menus."
msgstr ""
"Bellum apparatus et navis constructiones monstrare in Officina Belli et "
"portus menus constructum sumptuum sunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show total production queue count and cost for War Factories and Harbours."
msgstr ""
"Ostendere summam productionem queue comitem et sumptus pro Bellum officinas "
"et portus."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Show keybinds at the bottom-left of buttons that have them."
msgstr "Ostende ligamenta in fundo-sinistra bullarum quae eas habent."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Add a keybind for cancelling menus (defaults to Esc), settable in config.txt "
"with `bindkey = KEYEVENT_ _CANCEL,Escape`."
msgstr ""
"Adde ligamen ligaminis ad menus rescindendum (defaltis ad Esc), componendum "
"in config.txt cum `bindkey = KEYEVENT_ _CANCEL,Escape`."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show Spy combat (in Forts) or primary skill (in other Firms) level in the "
"worker list by moving the spy icon to the portrait."
msgstr ""
"Ostende pugnam speculatorem (in Forts) seu primariam ars (in aliis Firms) "
"gradus in indice laborantis speculatores iconum ad imaginem movendo."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added thousands separators to treasury and food store amounts, to make "
"reading them easier.  (Currently, this uses groups of three with a comma as "
"the separator for everyone.  Proper localisation will be added later.)"
msgstr ""
"Millia separatorum ad aerarium et horrea adiecit, quo facilius legeretur.  "
"(In statu hic utitur ternae commatis ut separatoris pro omnibus. localisatio "
"propria postea addetur)."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the war machine technology level on the portrait, instead of as part of "
"the name, on the War Factory build list.  This frees up some room for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Ostende bellum machinam ars gradus in imagine, pro parte nominis, in Bellum "
"officinam fabricandi indicem.  Hic locus aliquos pro maiori notitia absolvit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.1.4 -- 2025-04-28"
msgstr "v3.1.4 -- 2025-04-28"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed spy change nation colours not working properly and corruption with "
"buttons on info pane.  (Temporarly removed the leadership panel until a "
"better solution is implemented.)"
msgstr ""
"Correcta est mutatio colorum nationis a speculatore quae recte non "
"operabatur et corruptio bullarum in tabella informationum. (Tabella ductus "
"temporarie remota est donec melior solutio adhibeatur.)"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.1.3 -- 2025-04-27"
msgstr "v3.1.3 -- 2025-04-27"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added clipboard keys (Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V) to input fields, such as the "
"address of the \"Enter Address\" multiplayer option, map ID, and name fields."
msgstr ""
"Adiectae sunt claves clipboard (Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V) ad agros inputandi, "
"ut inscriptio \"Intra Oratio\" pluribus optionis, tabula ID, et nomen "
"agrorum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Allow prepending to (adding to to the start of) production queues with "
"Ctrl+click, allowing quickly producing a unit without clearing the entire "
"queue."
msgstr ""
"Permittitur ordini productionis in principio addere per pressionem cum Ctrl, "
"ut unitas celeriter produci possit sine toto ordine delendo."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Automatically copy the map ID to the clipboard when opening the in-game "
"menu, allowing for easy copy-pasting of the map ID."
msgstr ""
"Automatice tabulam ID ad clipboard effingo cum tabulam in venatione "
"aperiens, permittens ad facilem exemplar tabulae ID."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Automatically paste into the join address field, allowing for easy joining "
"of games when using the \"Enter Address\" option."
msgstr ""
"Automatice crustulum in agrum electronicum iungi sinit, ludorum juncturas "
"faciles cum optione \"Intra Oratio\" utens."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added a What's New screen, shown on the first startup of each new version."
msgstr ""
"Quid Novum tegumentum adiecit, primo cuiusque novi versionis initium "
"monstratum est."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed setting rally point from a Town using shift also pulling peasants."
msgstr "Certum soeios cuspis ex oppido utens trabea etiam rusticos evellens."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed pixel artefacts on the bottom of credits and results screens."
msgstr "Pixela artificiorum fixa in fundo creditorum et proventuum pluteorum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed pixel artefact on text update."
msgstr "Fixum pixel artefactum in textu renovatio."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed Alt+right-click not pulling peasants from a Town in Classic mode."
msgstr ""
"Correctum est ne Alt cum pressione dextra rusticos ex Oppido in modo "
"classico trahere desineret."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.1.2 -- 2025-04-20"
msgstr "v3.1.2 -- 2025-04-20"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show an icon for units which are outside of their general's command range "
"and so do not receive combat bonuses and are losing loyalty."
msgstr ""
"Imaginem monstrare pro unitates quae extra mandatum dux sunt iactus et ideo "
"bonuses pugnam non accipiunt et fidem amittunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Display unit leadership effect status in the info pane."
msgstr "Ostenditur status effectus ductus unitatis in tabella informationum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Make War Factory production queue unlimited, up from 20."
msgstr "Officina Bellum productio queue illimitata fac, usque ab XX."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Make Harbour production queue unlimited, up from 10."
msgstr "Fac productionem portus queue illimitata, usque ab 10 ."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the production queue size for Towns, Harbours, and War Factories over "
"the production button, in a manner similar to the auto-tax."
msgstr ""
"Ostende productionem queue magnitudine oppidis, portus, et Bellum officinas "
"super conjunctionem productionis, modo simili auto-vectigal."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed desync when cancelling training in a Town."
msgstr ""
"Correcta est discrepantia synchroniae cum exercitatio in Oppido abrogatur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed alignment of town goods satisfaction, inn guest count, and worker list."
msgstr ""
"Certa alignment de bonis villae satisfactio, hospitii hospitis comitis, et "
"operariorum indice."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed Town training queue counts not showing correctly after loading a game "
"with a 7kaa training queue."
msgstr ""
"Firma disciplina queue Urbs numerat non recte ostendens post oneratisque "
"lusum cum 7kaa disciplina queue."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed not being able to cancel production after loading a 7kaa save game "
"with a unit already in production."
msgstr ""
"Certum non esse posse productionem delere postquam 7kaa onerant praeter "
"lusum cum unitate iam in productione."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed not being able to cancel units in the queue after loading a 7kaa save "
"game with an existing production queue."
msgstr ""
"Certum non posse unitates in queue rescindere, post 7kaa onusque ludum cum "
"productione queue existente."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Display the type and level of war machines inside forts, for easier "
"identification."
msgstr ""
"Formam et gradus de bellum machinis intra castella expone, ad identitatem "
"faciliorem."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Harbour production queue persists even when the harbour is full (4 ships) "
"instead of clearing the queue."
msgstr ""
"Portus productionis queue persistit etiam cum portus plenus (4 navibus) loco "
"queue purgandi."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.1.1 -- 2025-04-12"
msgstr "v3.1.1 -- 2025-04-12"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Rally points can be toggled by setting the rally point to the same place "
"again, in addition to alt-right-clicking on the building again."
msgstr ""
"Puncta conventus alternari possunt idem punctum iterum ponendo, praeter "
"pressionem dextram cum Alt in aedificio iteratam."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Waypoints (and rally points) can now be set (and unset) with shift-right-"
"click in addition to alt-right-click, to be more intuitive to people."
msgstr ""
"Puncta viae (et puncta conventus) nunc poni atque removeri possunt pressione "
"dextra cum Shift, praeter pressionem dextram cum Alt, ut usus magis "
"naturalis sit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added a rally point button on the info pane for buildings, which shows when "
"a rally point is active.  Clicking on it goes to the rally location and "
"right-clicking on it clears the rally point."
msgstr ""
"Addita est bulla puncti conventus in tabella informationum pro aedificiis, "
"quae ostenditur cum punctum conventus activum est. Eam premendo ad locum "
"conventus itur et eam dextra premendo punctum conventus deletur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added T (actually the same as the unit settle key) as a key to clear the "
"rally point of a building."
msgstr ""
"Addidit T (actu idem quod unitas clavis insidens) ut clavis ad colligendum "
"punctum aedificii purgandum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed positioning of the colour box on the info pane for buildings and units."
msgstr ""
"Correcta est collocatio arculae coloris in tabella informationum pro "
"aedificiis et unitatibus."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed porcupines and other not-attacking units not following waypoints."
msgstr "Certae hystrices aliaeque non oppugnandae unitates non sequuntur vias."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.1.0 -- 2025-04-06"
msgstr "v3.1.0 -- 2025-04-06"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added rally points for War Factory war machines."
msgstr "Soeii puncta addita pro machinis Officina Belli bellum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added rally points for Town peasants and trained units."
msgstr "Soeios adiecit puncta pro pagis rusticis et exercitatis augentibus."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added rally points for Inn hired units."
msgstr "Soeiam puncta additae pro Unitatibus Deversorium conductitiis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added rally points for Camp units when sortieing."
msgstr "Soeiam adiecit puncta ad turmas castrorum cum eruptione facta."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added rally points for all firms when mobilising workers."
msgstr "Soeios addit puncta omnium firmorum cum operarios movens."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added rally points for Harbours when sailing ships."
msgstr "Naves navigantes portus additi sunt soeii."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed a crash on requesting a builder when one is on a ship."
msgstr "Fragorem fixum petens aedificatorem cum quis in navi est."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Make Town training queue unlimited, up from 10."
msgstr "Facite urbana disciplina queue illimitata, usque ab 10 ."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Use global research target for all new and newly idle Towers of Science, not "
"just the ones that were present when first clicking."
msgstr ""
"In global investigatio scopum utere omnibus turribus Scientiarum novis et "
"nuper otiosis, non iis tantum, qui in primis clicking aderant."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Waypoints can now be set to attack and enter buildings instead of just "
"moving to a destination."
msgstr ""
"Punctae viae nunc ad impetus apponi possunt et aedificia inire loco modo ad "
"destinatum movens."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Waypoints now no longer get cleared if the unit cannot reach one "
"destination, allowing for exploration without interruption."
msgstr ""
"Punctae iam non amplius purgari possunt si unitas ad unum destinatum "
"pervenire non potest, permittens explorationem sine intermissione."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Rally points can also be set to attack and enter buildings instead of just "
"moving to a destination, the same as waypoints."
msgstr ""
"Convivia puncta etiam ad impetus apponi possunt et aedificia inire loco modo "
"ad locum destinatum, sicut puncta viae."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Rally points are now visible over unexplored blackness."
msgstr "Convivia puncta nunc apparent in inexploratae nigredinis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Setting a rally point on a building will not pull peasants to it."
msgstr ""
"Constituens punctum in aedificium soeium rusticos non trahere ad illud."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.0.4 -- 2025-03-16"
msgstr "v3.0.4 -- 2025-03-16"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added delete button to load game menu."
msgstr "Addita est bulla delendi ad indicem ludorum onerandorum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Show a progress bar on the map for town training."
msgstr "Monstrare progressum vectis in tabula ad exercitationem civitatis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed requested builder not being able to reach the destination building if "
"there is no walkable path."
msgstr ""
"Certum petitum aedificatorem non posse ad destinationem aedificii pervenire, "
"si semita ambulabilis non est."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed Inn hire button being enabled/disabled incorrectly."
msgstr "Fixum Deversorium pretium felis cum enabled / erret non recte."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed hitbars having extra pixels on the right when a worker enters or "
"leaves the building."
msgstr ""
"Hitbars fixum habens elementa extra in dextera cum operarius intrat vel "
"relinquit aedificium."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Continue loading config.txt even when there are invalid lines, so that the "
"valid ones still apply.  Then, once finished loading, display all the line "
"numbers which contained errors, allowing fixing them."
msgstr ""
"Perge loading config.txt etiam cum invalidae sunt lineae, ut validae adhuc "
"applicentur.  Dein, finito oneratione, omnes numeros, qui errores "
"continebant, ostentant, eosque defigentes permittit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.0.3 -- 2025-03-07"
msgstr "v3.0.3 -- 2025-03-07"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show a progress bar for Harbours.  (They were missed when Towers of Science "
"and War Factories were done.)"
msgstr ""
"Ostende progressum vectis ad portus.  (omissi sunt cum officinas turres "
"Scientiarum et Bellum factae sunt.)"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the town recruitment progress bar overlapping the buttons when a spy "
"is present and the spy button is showing."
msgstr ""
"Fixum est oppidum cooptatione progressus vectis imbricatis globulis cum "
"speculator adest et puga speculator ostendit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.0.2 -- 2025-03-04"
msgstr "v3.0.2 -- 2025-03-04"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show town goods demand satisfaction (quality of life) to know how much goods "
"are demanded and how much are being supplied--and thus the level of the "
"bonus."
msgstr ""
"Ostenditur satisfactio postulationis mercium oppidi (qualitas vitae) ut "
"sciatur quantum mercium postuletur et quantum praebeatur--atque ita gradus "
"auctarii."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Show a progress bar for Towers of Science and War Factories."
msgstr ""
"Ostendere vectem progressum pro turribus officinarum Scientiarum et Bellum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the unit path line (and building connection lines) animation speed "
"breaking on game speed unlimited (9).  This should also fix the issue some "
"users were having where moving the mouse would speed up the line animation."
msgstr ""
"Fixum est iter unitatis lineae (constructio linearum connexionis) animatio "
"celeritas in ludo celeritas infinito interrupto (9).  Hoc quoque eventum "
"figere debet aliquos utentes habere ubi murem celeritas recta animationem "
"movere vellet."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed the building hitbars looking kind of off and tilted."
msgstr "Fixum est aedificium hitbars vultus genus off et iugo."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fix high CPU usage on showing help on hover."
msgstr "Altum CPU usus adhibe in ostendens auxilium in volitando."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Scale unit hitbar widths with the (square root of) their maximum hitpoints, "
"to give a better idea of units' toughness at a glance."
msgstr ""
"Scala unitatis hitbarorum latitudinum cum maximorum punctorum suorum "
"(quadrata radice) ut melius notionem unitatum 'durationis in visu praebeat'."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Add more hitbar colours (dark green, orange, red) to make judging unit "
"tougness easier."
msgstr ""
"Plures colores hitbar addere (nigri viridis, aurantiacis, rubris) ut unitas "
"duritiem facilius diiudicaret."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Draw town/building link lines consistently in the same direction, regardless "
"of which side is selected.  Since some links make sense only as bi-"
"directional flow, these links are drawn alternating in both direction."
msgstr ""
"Ducta villa/aedificans lineas nexus in eandem partem constanter, cuiuscumque "
"pars est electa.  Cum quaedam nexus solum sensum faciunt sicut fluxus bi-"
"directionalis, hae nexus in utramque partem alternatim trahuntur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Darkened the bottom-left pixel of the hitbar outline to make it look more in "
"place."
msgstr ""
"Fundum-sinistrae pixel delineandi adumbrationem obtenebratur ut magis in "
"loco intueatur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.0.1 -- 2025-02-25"
msgstr "v3.0.1 -- 2025-02-25"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added game speed display to top-right of the map and \"PAUSED\" in the "
"middle."
msgstr ""
"Ludi celeritatis ostentatio in angulo dextro superiore tabulae addita est, "
"et \"SUSPENSUS\" in medio."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the guest count in an inn, to make it easy to know whether scrolling is "
"even required."
msgstr ""
"Ostenditur numerus hospitum in deversorio, ut facile sciatur num volutatio "
"omnino requiratur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the amount that non-spy units have been rewarded, so that it's easier "
"to tell the effects of the contribution on loyalty."
msgstr ""
"Ostende quanti unitates non speculatoriae praemiatae fuerint, quo facilius "
"effecta fidei contributionis narrare possit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed high CPU usage when moving the mouse cursor in-game.  This should also "
"fix the unit path line looking like it's moving when the mouse cursor is "
"moved."
msgstr ""
"Summum fixum CPU usus, cum murem cursorem in- feras movens.  Hoc etiam debet "
"figere lineam unitatis semitam similem esse movens cum cursore mure movetur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed minimap bounding box colours."
msgstr "Correcti sunt colores capsae circumscribentis parvae tabulae."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Display inn guest list from newest at the top to oldest at the bottom, so "
"that it's quicker to check inns for new mercenaries."
msgstr ""
"Indicem hospitum ex recentissimo in summo ad vetustissimum in imo diversorio "
"exhibe, quo citius stabula pro novis mercennariis coercenda est."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Preferentially use builders from undamaged buildings further away instead of "
"from closer buildings that are still not fully repaired."
msgstr ""
"Potius ab ædificiis integris ædificijs utuntur loco arctiore ædificijs quae "
"adhuc non plene reparantur absunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Use all of the available space in the building info pane to show wider unit "
"hitbars, so that they're easier to comprehend."
msgstr ""
"Adhibetur omne spatium praesto in tabella informationum aedificii ad "
"latiores virgas valetudinis unitatum ostendendas, ut facilius intellegantur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the missing portion of unit hitbars in the building info pane, so that "
"it's easier to tell when a unit is missing hitpoints."
msgstr ""
"Ostenditur pars deficiens virgarum valetudinis unitatum in tabella "
"informationum aedificii, ut facilius dignoscatur cum unitati puncta "
"valetudinis desunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Draw a hitbar for the general/king in a camp, so that you can see his health."
msgstr "Pro dux/rex in castra duc hitbar, ut valetudinem eius videre possis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Properly centre units in the building info pane, so that the hitbars are "
"clearly discernible."
msgstr ""
"Unitates recte in media tabella informationum aedificii ponuntur, ut virgae "
"valetudinis dilucide discerni possint."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Use a four-slot screen for the mode selection.  This gives more space to "
"expand the description text."
msgstr ""
"Quattuor scrinii foramen pro modo utere lectio.  Hoc plus spatii dat ad "
"textum descriptionis ampliandum."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Use roman numerals for numbering modes on the mode selection screen.  This "
"aesthetic is more appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Numeris romanis utere ad modos numerandi in modo ducto delectu.  Haec "
"aesthetica aptior est."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Make mode selection screen translatable.  No translations have been "
"completed yet, though."
msgstr ""
"Fac modum electionis velum translatable.  Non translationes confectae sunt "
"tamen, quamquam."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.0.0 -- 2025-02-21"
msgstr "v3.0.0 -- 2025-02-21"

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Display the current running mode in top-right of the main menu."
msgstr "Praesens currentem modum monstrare in top-ius elencho principalis."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added a rudimentary running mode switcher accessible from a button at the "
"top-right of the main menu."
msgstr ""
"Additus est rudimentarius commutator modi currendi, qui ex bulla in summa "
"parte dextra indicis principalis adiri potest."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Made the game look smoother by running at at a graphical 60 FPS."
msgstr "Ludum fecit leviorem currendo ad graphicum 60 FPS."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added cyan highlight to selected units, making for easier identification."
msgstr ""
"Addidit cyan CALEO ad unitates selectas, faciens pro facilior identificatio."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added coloured outline to hit bars, making it easier to distinguish friendly "
"units' hit bars from enemies'."
msgstr ""
"Clausis feriendis adumbratim additur coloratum, quo facilius unitates "
"amicabiles ' ab inimicis vectes discernere' facit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Show a hitbar for firms when they are at less than 100% HP."
msgstr "Monstrare hitbar pro firmis, cum minus quam 100% HP sunt."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added builder icon to buildings with builders in them, allowing easy at-a-"
"glance identification of them."
msgstr ""
"Addita est imago structoris ad aedificia in quibus structores sunt, ut "
"facile uno aspectu dignoscantur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Made the game look smoother by constantly animating buildings at a fixed "
"rate."
msgstr ""
"Faciebat ludum spectaculo levius assidue animantia tecta ad certam ratem."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Made the game look smoother by constantly animating water and other terrain "
"at a fixed rate."
msgstr ""
"Ludum spectavi molliorem fecit assidue aquam animantem et alia loca ad "
"certam ratem."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Made the game look smoother by having the water be more sloshy and run "
"approximately into the south-western direction as the waves imply."
msgstr ""
"Ludum fecit spectare leviorem habendo aquam tardiorem esse et proxime in "
"meridiem-occidentalem currere quam fluctus implicant."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Made the game look smoother by continuing rain and snow while game is paused."
msgstr ""
"Ludum fecit spectare leviorem continuando pluviam et nivem dum ludus "
"intermittitur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Display more details when a multiplayer sync error occurs to help hunt down "
"and fix the cause."
msgstr ""
"Plura demonstrare singula cum lusoribus sync erroris incidit ut auxilium "
"persequatur et causam defigat."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fixed the 100% CPU usage all the time problem."
msgstr "C% CPU usus totius temporis quaestionem posuit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed scrolling to the right and down not working properly."
msgstr ""
"Correcta est volutatio ad dextram et deorsum quae recte non operabatur."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the unit path line flow direction to go from the unit to its "
"destination instead of backwards."
msgstr ""
"Iter lineae unitas statuit directionem fluere ut ab unitate ad destinatum "
"suum loco retrocedat."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Centred the info pane (the one below the minimap) so that it's no longer off-"
"centre."
msgstr ""
"In medium posita est tabella informationum (ea infra parvam tabulam) ut non "
"amplius a centro absit."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed a memory leak when loading a saved game."
msgstr "Memoriam posuit Leak cum onerant servati venatus."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed a memory leak with unit waypoints."
msgstr "Certa memoria Leak cum unitate waypoints."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Use yellow colour for highlighting units on hover instead of cyan."
msgstr "Color flavus utere ad illustrandas unitates pro cyan."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Made it easier to see when units are low on hitpoints by making the unit "
"hitbars wider."
msgstr ""
"Facilius perspicitur cum unitates in punctis iacentes efficiendo hitbarum "
"unitas latiora."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Change right and bottom cursor boundaries to allow the cursor to go further."
msgstr "Mutare ius et fundum cursorem limites cursorem longius ire permittunt."

#: src/CmdLine.cpp:50
#, c-format
msgid "The command line option %s requires an argument."
msgstr "Praeceptum rectam optionem %s argumentum requirit."

#: src/CmdLine.cpp:60
msgid "Multiple startup mode options present on the command line."
msgstr "Satus modus multiplex optiones rectae in imperio adessent."

